<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5109] Refactoring for SparseDistributedMatrix</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5109</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;According to &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; we should change logic of this matrix. Creating new cache each time when we create new matrix is really bad idea.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So we must use one dedicated cache for ML matrices.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
