&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5109&quot; title=&quot;Refactoring for SparseDistributedMatrix&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-5109&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-5109&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Refactoring for SparseDistributedMatrix:&lt;/p&gt;

